ows: 154\n- Review rows: 52\n- Manual rows: 626\n- Failed/blocker rows: 1\n- Student-display eligible rows: 0\n- External VLM calls: 0\n\n## Verification\n\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-figureasset-bulk-precise-source-crops.mjs --check` PASS\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-figureasset-bulk-crop-completeness-qa.mjs --check` PASS\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/figureasset-bulk-precise-crops-and-qa.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/figureasset-wave1-precise-source-crops.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/figureasset-wave1-crop-completeness-qa.test.js` PASS, 3 suites / 5 tests\n- Independent count/file probe PASS: 833 QA rows, 815 crop files, posture sum 833, missing crop files 0\n- `git diff --check` PASS\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` PASS with expected warnings for dirty worktree before commit and branch naming (`feat/issue-1257`)","created_at":"2026-07-04T17:14:31Z","updated_at":"2026-07-04T17:24:56Z","closed_at":"2026-07-04T17:24:55Z","merged_at":"2026-07-04T17:24:55Z","merge_commit_sha":"d33742338fcecf23b93f3231d1d584bb3d684a34","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1274/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1274/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1274/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/d71a7a7e77173e40e4e89b714071fa44196b417f","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1257","ref":"feat/issue-1257","sha":"d71a7a7e77173e40e4e89b714071fa44196b417f","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","